    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Ad Targeting Engine\r\n\r\nPlan how your video streaming platform decides **what ads to show viewers**.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Choose two **True/False** questions (your conditions).\r\n  \r\n2. Build a **flowchart** using those questions to make decisions.\r\n \r\n3. Create **four outcomes**. For each, include a specific **image** and **text message**.\r\n \r\n4. Complete the **Test Cases table** showing how each combination of True/False leads to an outcome.\r\n \r\n5. Save your flowchart to your **Backpack**.",
    "display_name": "Ad Targeting Engine",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Plan how your platform decides which ads to show different viewers based on their profile and behavior.",
